      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "000"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "大丈夫だよ\r\nもしかして、第３審査の結果のことかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今回も無事通過できたぞ\r\nおめでとう！　咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n夢の舞台まで、あと１歩だな……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　どうしたんだ、やけに冷静だな）",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、第３審査まで残れたんだから\r\nもっと喜んでいいんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。これでも喜んでいるんだよ？\r\nただ、喜びよりも先に、考えてしまっていたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ここまで来たら、優勝したい\r\nなら今の自分には、何ができるか……をね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\nさすが咲耶だな、頼もしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "頼もしいだなんて……\r\n私はただ、みんなの喜んでいる顔が見たいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーに対しても同じ気持ちなんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーにも、喜んでほしいんだ\r\nそう思えば私はがんばれる",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私は、みんなのために必ず優勝してみせる",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、ちゃんと私を見ててくれるかい？\r\nプロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600105/7006001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、当然そのつもりだよ\r\n俺はいつでも咲耶を見ている",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001050120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nその言葉、なによりも心強いよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
